  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Divination; <strong>CL</strong> 4th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 800 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis milky grey substance has a musky smell and a taste of dirt and grime. Those that drink the potion gain a bonus of +2 to Disable Device and Perception checks related to traps, and the ability to disarm magic traps as if they possessed the trapfinding rogue class feature. The effects of the potion have a duration of 4 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Divination sphere (See Hazard (sense), Trapfinding (advanced, sense)); <strong>Cost</strong> 400 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: 800 gp.</p><p>One milky-grey dose with its published negligible weight. Temporary trap benefits require drinking; merely carrying the vial grants no skill bonus or rogue class feature.</p><p>Single-dose quantity is consumed through the native helper. Target outcomes, temporary effects and any external eligibility remain deliberate; carrying the bottle grants no persistent bonus.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
